required  17.14 Series for AI1        on the interval  1.25000D-01 to  3.33333D-01\n                                        with weighted error   6.98E-17\n                                         log weighted error  16.16\n                               significant figures required  14.53\n                                    decimal places required  16.82 Series for AI12       on the interval  0.          to  1.25000D-01\n                                        with weighted error   3.55E-17\n                                         log weighted error  16.45\n                               significant figures required  14.69\n                                    decimal places required  17.12 REFERENCES  (NONE) ROUTINES CALLED  CSEVL, INITS, R1MACH, XERMSG REVISION HISTORY  (YYMMDD)\n   770401  DATE WRITTEN\n   890210  REVISION DATE from Version 3.2\n   891214  Prologue converted to Version 4.0 format.  (BAB)\n   900315  CALLs to XERROR changed to CALLs to XERMSG.  (THJ)\n   900326  Removed duplicate information from DESCRIPTION section.\n           (WRB)\n   920618  Removed space from variable names.  (RWC, WRB) END PROLOGUE  BESI1E\n**FIRST EXECUTABLE STATEMENT  BESI1E Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real :: X Return Value real","tags":"","url":"proc/besi1e.html"},{"title":"FREQUENCIES_coarse_grid – Yambo","text":"subroutine FREQUENCIES_coarse_grid(title, bg_pt, npts, cg_percentual, in_pt, lterm) Uses pars com vec_operate frequency Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: title real(kind=SP), intent(in) :: bg_pt (npts) integer, intent(in) :: npts real(kind=SP), intent(in) :: cg_percentual real(kind=SP), intent(in) :: in_pt (*) logical, intent(in) :: lterm","tags":"","url":"proc/frequencies_coarse_grid.html"},{"title":"MATRIX_slepc – Yambo","text":"subroutine MATRIX_slepc(M_slepc, n_eig, V_right, V_left, E_real, E_cmpl) Uses stderr slepcsysdef petscsysdef pars com petscsys petscmat BS_solvers UNITS petscmatdef sl